  "task_id": 10450,
  "title": "Keep your goals to yourself",
  "author": "Derek Sivers",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/derek_sivers_keep_your_goals_to_yourself",
  "annotation_id": 151,
  "completed_by": 5,
  "created_at": "2026-04-27T04:47:32.529823Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-04-27T04:47:32.529867Z",
  "lead_time": 460.941,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "Everyone, please think of your biggest personal goal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "fnkJOGMxAE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "For real -- you can take a second.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "Gz-38RYrXE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "You've got to feel this to learn it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "cBngHF0u9A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "Take a few seconds and think of your personal biggest goal, okay?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "S0RmSuPBv-",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "Imagine deciding right now that you're going to do it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "tRAiIVPRGv",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "Imagine telling someone that you meet today what you're going to do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "cmNQCxguvb",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "Imagine their congratulations, and their high image of you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "q5VCuBDW-M",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "Imagine deciding right now that you're going to do it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "KtX5RM-14T",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "Imagine telling someone that you meet today what you're going to do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C9onS1aOTD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "Imagine their congratulations, and their high image of you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DDx_2QbJtH",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "Doesn't it feel good to say it out loud?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AndJmPWRrE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "Don't you feel one step closer already, like it's already becoming part of your identity?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ItM6FPSisw",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "Well, bad news: you should have kept your mouth shut, because that good feeling now will make you less likely to do it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "rJHAwudGI7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "The repeated psychology tests have proven that telling someone your goal makes it less likely to happen.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "N41j5ccW_3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 124,
        "text": "Any time you have a goal, there are some steps that need to be done, some work that needs to be done in order to achieve it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7UBQbuEwoV",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "Ideally you would not be satisfied until you'd actually done the work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "sihCVlEZug",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 122,
        "text": "But when you tell someone your goal and they acknowledge it, psychologists have found that it's called a \"social reality.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "h-f8MqM3N_",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "The mind is kind of tricked into feeling that it's already done.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3ckhhrC63B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "And then because you've felt that satisfaction, you're less motivated to do the actual hard work necessary.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1tpOIEhamN",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "(Laughter) (Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "Tjn8phLz4O",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "So audience, next time you're tempted to tell someone your goal, what will you say?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8QzvfgNH6U",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 10,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "Exactly!",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "i_ibeXoecG",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Well done.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "Obq-oAbgPp",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 219,
        "text": "But if you do need to talk about something, you can state it in a way that gives you no satisfaction, such as, \"I really want to run this marathon, so I need to train five times a week and kick my ass if I don't, okay?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "fwxAPPSqfi",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 144,
        "text": "You can delay the gratification that the social acknowledgment brings, and you can understand that your mind mistakes the talking for the doing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "IZ1AiUo-HO",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "Well, you could resist the temptation to announce your goal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D_ey-zWW2J",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "So if this is true, what can we do?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "kxjFn0y0PK",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 153,
        "text": "But those who had announced it quit after only 33 minutes, on average, and when asked afterward, said that they felt much closer to achieving their goal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "h3-Fc5jPaY",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 184,
        "text": "Now, those who kept their mouths shut worked the entire 45 minutes on average, and when asked afterward, said that they felt that they had a long way to go still to achieve their goal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "tRvVHHQdVo",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 101,
        "text": "So this goes against conventional wisdom that we should tell our friends our goals, right?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B8cG-ptfiw",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "So they hold us to it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "T4ovacfPiX",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "So, let's look at the proof. 1926: Kurt Lewin, founder of social psychology, called this \"substitution.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "cvHXK_39ND",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 195,
        "text": "1933: Wera Mahler found when it was acknowledged by others, it felt real in the mind. 1982, Peter Gollwitzer wrote a whole book about this, and in 2009, he did some new tests that were published.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6McOlgxTRI",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "It goes like this: 163 people across four separate tests.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DitIdhP-R0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "Everyone wrote down their personal goal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5iUKzOCrq2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 145,
        "text": "Then everyone was given 45 minutes of work that would directly lead them towards their goal, but they were told that they could stop at any time.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0vKHT1tuw5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}